Id: cont011w
Severity: WARN
Category: containers
Check: check_containers
References: https://docs.docker.com/engine/security/#docker-daemon-attack-surface
Controls: CIS 4.1, 5.4; NIST AC-6, CM-7; ISO 8.2, 8.9; CE Secure configuration, User access control

Daemon configuration (/etc/docker, daemon.json) is writable by
everyone: anyone on the system can change what the daemon reads at
startup, from its listening ports to its authorization plugins, and
the daemon runs as root. Writable-by-all daemon configuration hands
root to everyone.
